OL,6,
OL,7,FThe jury is set to resume deliberations
OL,8,Fin the trial of Lindsay Clancy, the US
OL,9,Fmother accused of murdering her three
OL,10,Fchildren
OL,12,FCourt is back in session in
OL,13,FMassachusetts - you can watch live
OL,14,Fabove
OL,16,FIt comes after a tense day in court on
OL,17,FThursday, where Clancy's defence lawyer
OL,18,Fasked the judge to dismiss a juror - a
OL,19,Frequest the judge denied
